+## 0.6.11
+
+- Fixed Windows generation failure `No mapping for the Unicode character exists in the target multi-byte code page` while indexing OpenMW data directories.
+- OpenMW `data=` paths are now decoded as UTF-8 and all solid-clearance filesystem paths are logged/stored as UTF-8 instead of using the active ANSI code page.
+- Added regression coverage for non-Latin data-directory and mesh-directory names.
+
 # Changelog
 
